---
---
<section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#fdf8e8] to-[#ffa90b] relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 mb-16">
            <div class="hidden md:block flex-1 h-[1px] bg-[#ffc04c]"></div>
            <h4 class="bg-[#ffc04c] text-white px-12 py-3 rounded-full text-lg tracking-widest uppercase text-center">
                #<br/>澄 WORLD 界
            </h4>
            <div class="hidden md:block flex-1 h-[1px] bg-[#ffc04c]"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center space-y-8 mb-20 relative z-10">
            <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-[#2D2E33] leading-tight tracking-[0.2em]">
                圖著妝去訴說<br/>視界與溫度的連結
            </h3>
            <div class="flex justify-center">
                <div class="relative w-64 h-64">
                    <img src="/wp-content/uploads/yootheme/cdivision-logo.svg" alt="C-Division Logo" class="w-full h-full relative z-10" />
                    <!-- Placeholder for the planet animation/shadows -->
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#f19917]/20 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 animate-pulse"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-24 bg-white relative">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-8">
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 text-4xl font-serif text-[#2D2E33]">
                    <span class="text-6xl text-[#f19917]">澄</span>
                    <h3>視維度。</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#545353] font-light tracking-wide first-letter:text-4xl first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-2">
                    之星球，裡面住著充滿好奇、喜歡思考和欣賞美好事物的澄星人，總想在圖像上為它們著上不同的色彩及形態妝扮，並致力將它們融入種種情感、語言、生命力、或能量…，願人們與它們視線交集匯聚的須臾間，能覺察或連結出圖像裏層蘊藏的事物、喚起內在感受或與之共鳴，找回形體內的本質與生命力，用愛與溫度孵化而出的一星球視界。
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/3">
                <img src="/wp-content/uploads/REMCOVER.jpg" alt="About Cover" class="rounded-[50px] shadow-2xl border-4 border-[#ffc04c]/20" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-24 bg-[#ff9600] text-[#2D2E33]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 mb-16 transform skew-y-[-2deg]">
             <div class="hidden md:block flex-1 h-[1px] bg-white/50"></div>
             <h2 class="bg-[#ffc04c] text-white px-12 py-3 rounded-full text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">界 Medium 質</h2>
             <div class="hidden md:block flex-1 h-[1px] bg-white/50"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 text-center transform skew-y-[-2deg]">
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-xl tracking-widest font-serif">
                <li class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2">逸彩之體</li>
                <li>心流之水</li>
                <li>生命之力</li>
                <li>靈動之力</li>
                <li>溫度之液</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-xl tracking-widest font-serif opacity-80">
                <li>心之所愛</li>
                <li>HEART</li>
                <li>LOVE</li>
                <li>WEB</li>
                <li>ART</li>
                <li>DESIGN</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-xl tracking-widest font-serif">
                <li>語言</li>
                <li>靈魂</li>
                <li>情感</li>
                <li>能量</li>
                <li>覺知</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
